  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{s}\\,r & =\\frac{r\\cdot s}{s\\cdot s}s \\\\  & =\\frac{{r}_{x}{s}_{x}+{r}_{y}{s}_{y}+{r}_{z}{s}_{z}}{{s}_{x}^{2}+{s}_{y}^{2}+{s}_{z}^{2}}s \\\\  & =\\frac{(1)\\cdot 3+(3)\\cdot (-1)+(4)\\cdot 0}{{3}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}}s \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{{3}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}}s \\\\  & =\u27e80,0,0\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
